#: inc/admin/admin-options.php:1469
msgid "If the Turnstile widget is not showing, disable <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">Element Caching</a> for the Elementor form on your page, or try switching Integration Method."
msgstr "如果沒有顯示 Turnstile 小工具，代表必須為相關頁面的 Elementor 聯絡表單停用 <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">Element 快取</a>，或切換 [整合方法]。"

#: inc/admin/admin-options.php:1456
msgid "Page IDs (comma-separated)"
msgstr "頁面 ID (使用逗號分隔)"

#: inc/admin/admin-options.php:1451
msgid "Loads scripts only on the page IDs you enter below. Leave the list empty to load nowhere."
msgstr "僅在符合下方輸入的頁面 ID 的頁面載入指令碼。留空代表不在任何位置載入指令碼。"

#: inc/admin/admin-options.php:1448
msgid "Loads scripts only on pages that include an Elementor Form or Login widget. Popups or global templates may not be detected."
msgstr "僅在頁面包含 Elementor 聯絡表單或登入小工具時載入指令碼。可能無法偵測到彈出式訊息或全域範本。"

#: inc/admin/admin-options.php:1445
msgid "Loads scripts on all Elementor pages. Use this if caching breaks the element-based method. May load scripts on pages without forms."
msgstr "在全部 Elementor 頁面載入指令碼。如果快取造成以元素為基礎的方法，請使用這項設定。這項設定可能會在沒有包含聯絡表單的頁面載入指令碼。"

#: inc/admin/admin-options.php:1442
msgid "Enter specific page IDs"
msgstr "輸入指定頁面 ID"

#: inc/admin/admin-options.php:1441
msgid "Autodetect pages with forms"
msgstr "自動偵測包含聯絡表單的頁面"

#: inc/admin/admin-options.php:1440
msgid "All Elementor pages"
msgstr "全部 Elementor Forms 頁面"

#: inc/admin/admin-options.php:1437
msgid "Load scripts on:"
msgstr "指令碼載入位置:"

#: inc/admin/admin-options.php:1426
msgid "Instead of using this option, try disabling Element caching first."
msgstr "使用這項設定前，請先嘗試停用 Element 快取再做決定。"

#: inc/admin/admin-options.php:1425
msgid "Scripts are loaded globally on all Elementor pages. This method works better with some caching but may load scripts on pages without forms."
msgstr "在全部 Elementor 頁面全域載入指令碼。這個方法會比一些使用快取的狀況下效果更好，但可能會在沒有表單的頁面載入指令碼。"

#: inc/admin/admin-options.php:1421
msgid "(Recommended) Scripts are loaded when each form element is rendered. This is the ideal method but may not work with some caching. Have issues? Try disabling Element caching."
msgstr "(建議使用) 在轉譯全部元素時載入指令碼。這是最理想的方法，但卻可能在某些快取的狀況下無法運作。如果發生問題，請停用元素快取。"

#: inc/admin/admin-options.php:1415
msgid "Load Scripts Globally"
msgstr "全域載入指令碼"

#: inc/admin/admin-options.php:1412
msgid "Load Scripts Via Element"
msgstr "透過元素載入指令碼"

#: inc/admin/admin-options.php:1407
msgid "Integration Method"
msgstr "整合方法"

#: inc/admin/admin-options.php:493
msgid "Adds better compatibility with popular performance/optimization plugins (e.g. WP Rocket, LiteSpeed Cache, Autoptimize, Perfmatters, SG Optimizer) to prevent their JS optimizations from breaking Turnstile. Disable only if this causes issues."
msgstr "為使用常用的效能/最佳化外掛 (例如 WP Rocket、LiteSpeed Cache、Autoptimize、Perfmatters、SG Optimizer 等) 的網站帶來更加的相容性，以避免這類外掛的 JS 最佳化造成 Turnstile 停擺。僅有在這個功能造成問題才需要停用。"

#: inc/admin/admin-options.php:489
msgid "Performance Plugin Compatibility"
msgstr "效能外掛相容性"

#: inc/admin/admin-options.php:474
msgid "Performance"
msgstr "效能"

#: inc/admin/admin-options.php:435
msgid "Custom Messages"
msgstr "自訂訊息"

#: inc/admin/admin-options.php:358
msgid "Widget Customization"
msgstr "自訂小工具"

