msgid "Note: Currently Turnstile is not able to perform spam checks for some \"Express Checkout\" payment methods (e.g. PayPal, Google Pay, Apple Pay, Amazon Pay) and will skip them automatically."
msgstr "注意事項: Turnstile 目前無法對某些具備快速結帳功能的付款方法 (例如 PayPal、Google Pay、Apple Pay、Amazon Pay 等) 進行垃圾訊息檢查，並會自動略過這些付款方法。"

