msgid "Warning: This is not required. Only do this if you are comfortable editing wp-config.php. If you define the keys here, they will override the settings above."
msgstr "警告: 這不是必要設定，且僅有在具備編輯 wp-config.php 的權限時才能進行這項設定。如果將金鑰定義於 wp-config.php 中，就會覆寫上方的設定。"

