#: inc/admin/admin-options.php:161
msgid "Using keys defined in wp-config.php. Be sure to test your forms to confirm they are working."
msgstr "目前使用定義於 wp-config.php 中的金鑰。請務必測試這個網站的表單，以確認金鑰能否正確運作。"

